## CQ-LCA-01
@group client
@commands `logs/latest.log` after the title screen: grep `[compartment art]`
@pass one line, "68 textures built from installed mods" (57 CfB + 11 Incubation), no "sources not found" in the full pack
@fails `CompartmentArt.bytes` (mod file lookup or vanilla pack)
@reviewed 2026-11-16
bootexpect \[compartment art\] 68 textures built from installed mods
bootreject \[compartment art\].*sources not found
shell grep -n "\[compartment art\]" logs/latest.log | cut -c1-240
## CQ-LCA-02
@group client
@commands Place or JEI-view the 19 spice racks, 19 tool racks, 19 fruit baskets (one of each wood: oak, crimson, twisted, dreamwood, smoked, treated wood, vertical treated wood, rubberwood, ancient, driftwood)
@pass textured like before (the art in `textureswapper/rack/`), no missing texture; tool rack hooks gray
@fails `ArtRecipes.PLANKS` path, `TOOL_RACK_HOOKS`
@reviewed 2026-11-16
> fill 0 100 0 10 100 6 minecraft:stone
> setblock 0 101 2 creativedelight:oak_spice_rack
> setblock 0 101 4 creativedelight:oak_tool_rack
> setblock 0 101 6 creativedelight:oak_fruit_basket
> setblock 1 101 2 creativedelight:crimson_spice_rack
> setblock 1 101 4 creativedelight:crimson_tool_rack
> setblock 1 101 6 creativedelight:crimson_fruit_basket
> setblock 2 101 2 creativedelight:twisted_spice_rack
> setblock 2 101 4 creativedelight:twisted_tool_rack
> setblock 2 101 6 creativedelight:twisted_fruit_basket
> setblock 3 101 2 creativedelight:dreamwood_spice_rack
> setblock 3 101 4 creativedelight:dreamwood_tool_rack
> setblock 3 101 6 creativedelight:dreamwood_fruit_basket
> setblock 4 101 2 creativedelight:smoked_spice_rack
> setblock 4 101 4 creativedelight:smoked_tool_rack
> setblock 4 101 6 creativedelight:smoked_fruit_basket
> setblock 5 101 2 creativedelight:treated_wood_spice_rack
> setblock 5 101 4 creativedelight:treated_wood_tool_rack
> setblock 5 101 6 creativedelight:treated_wood_fruit_basket
> setblock 6 101 2 creativedelight:vertical_treated_wood_spice_rack
> setblock 6 101 4 creativedelight:vertical_treated_wood_tool_rack
> setblock 6 101 6 creativedelight:vertical_treated_wood_fruit_basket
> setblock 7 101 2 creativedelight:rubberwood_spice_rack
> setblock 7 101 4 creativedelight:rubberwood_tool_rack
> setblock 7 101 6 creativedelight:rubberwood_fruit_basket
> setblock 8 101 2 creativedelight:ancient_spice_rack
> setblock 8 101 4 creativedelight:ancient_tool_rack
> setblock 8 101 6 creativedelight:ancient_fruit_basket
> setblock 9 101 2 creativedelight:driftwood_spice_rack
> setblock 9 101 4 creativedelight:driftwood_tool_rack
> setblock 9 101 6 creativedelight:driftwood_fruit_basket
do {"look": {"from": "5 106 -4", "at": "5 101 4"}}
do {"wait": "chunks"}
shot racks_placed
do {"tooltip": "creativedelight:vertical_treated_wood_tool_rack"}
shot vertical_tool_rack_item
bootreject (?i)missing texture.*creativedelight:(\w+_)?(spice_rack|tool_rack|fruit_basket)
look textured like the art in textureswapper/rack/ (one row per kind, 10 woods), no purple-black; tool rack hooks grey
## CQ-LCA-03
@group client
@commands Duck nest, goose nest (block and item), emu nest with eggs, duck and goose egg crates (top and side), duck and goose eggs in nests
@pass as before (nests.md 4 table), no missing texture
@fails `ArtRecipes.INCUBATION` color maps
@reviewed 2026-11-16
> fill 0 100 10 8 100 12 minecraft:stone
> setblock 0 101 11 creativedelight:duck_nest
> setblock 2 101 11 creativedelight:goose_nest
> setblock 4 101 11 creativedelight:emu_nest
> setblock 6 101 11 creativedelight:duck_egg_crate
> setblock 8 101 11 creativedelight:goose_egg_crate
do {"look": {"from": "4 104 7", "at": "4 101 11"}}
do {"wait": "chunks"}
shot nests_and_crates
do {"tooltip": "creativedelight:goose_nest"}
shot goose_nest_item
look nests and crates (top and side) as nests.md 4; eggs in nests: place them by hand once (the egg item per nest), no missing texture
## CQ-LCA-04
@group client
@commands F3+T with a resource pack on; then `kubejs/assets/creativedelight/textures/block/emu_eggs.png` test file (NE-10)
@pass textures still there after reload; the kubejs file overrides the built emu eggs
@fails pack position (BOTTOM)
@reviewed 2026-11-16
> fill 0 100 10 4 100 12 minecraft:stone
> setblock 0 101 11 creativedelight:duck_nest
> setblock 4 101 11 creativedelight:emu_nest
do {"look": {"from": "2 104 7", "at": "2 101 11"}}
do {"wait": "chunks"}
shot before_reload
key F3+t
do {"wait": "resources"}
shot after_reload
look the built textures still drawn after the reload (the two shots match); the kubejs emu_eggs.png override (NE-10) needs a test copy of the owner's art in kubejs/assets: owner step
